#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Parole"
msgstr "Instalação do Parole"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Parole</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Parole</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid "Using Parole"
msgstr "Usando o Parole"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed Gstreamer Plugins Ugly with support for libdvdnav and "
"libdvdread and would like to use Parole to play a DVD, click Media&gt; Open "
"location and enter dvd:// into the box."
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver instalado o Gstreamer Plugins Ugly com suporte para libdvdnav "
"e libdvdread e gostaria de usar o Parole para reproduzir um DVD, clique em "
"Mídia&gt; Abra o local e digite dvd:// na caixa."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xfce/apps/parole.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Similarly, to play a CD, click Media&gt; Open location and enter cdda:// "
"into the box."
msgstr ""
"Similarmente, para reproduzir um CD, clique em Mídia&gt; Abra o local e "
"digite cdda:// na caixa."

